This directory is a modified copy of the rumqttd crate from the rumqtt
repository at the tag rumqttd-0.20.0 (commit
c03ba8bbb785dc6cd7809ce14fc2845d14b6bb74).

Changed by the toolsite project:

- Removed the network layer and everything that needs threads, sockets or
  a tokio runtime: src/server/, src/main.rs, src/link/remote.rs,
  src/link/network.rs, src/link/bridge.rs, src/link/console.rs,
  src/link/timer.rs, and src/replicator/ (which upstream does not build).
  The crate's examples/, rumqttd.toml and architecture.md are not copied.
- Removed the dependencies only those parts used, and the features that
  selected them (use-rustls, use-native-tls, websocket,
  verify-client-cert).
- Replaced the router's thread and blocking loop with Router::step, and
  added non-blocking ways to open a link and to collect its notifications.
- Allowed two lints crate-wide in src/lib.rs, for upstream items the
  removed parts used.
- Added src/step.rs: the network side of the broker as a step function,
  driven by whoever owns the sockets.

Each change and its reason is listed in ../FORK.md.
